title Prosumer Deletion Business Process

actor Prosumer
participant Camunda
participant VPPaaS
participant Kong
participant "Prosumer Service" as Service

Prosumer->Camunda: Fill deletion data\n(prosumerID)
Camunda->VPPaaS: Request Prosumer Deletion
activate VPPaaS
VPPaaS->VPPaaS: Verify if deletion is possible\n(promise: true/false)

alt promise = true
  VPPaaS-->Camunda: Promise
  Camunda->Prosumer: Confirm deletion order\n(accept: true/false)
  Prosumer->Camunda: Submit decision

  alt accept = true
    Camunda-->VPPaaS: Accept
    VPPaaS->Kong: DELETE /Prosumer/{id}
    Kong->Service: Forward Delete Request
    activate Service
    Service->Database: DELETE Prosumer record
    Database-->Service: OK
    Service-->Kong: Response
    deactivate Service
    Kong-->VPPaaS: Response
    VPPaaS-->Camunda: Declare (deleted)
  else accept = false
    Camunda-->VPPaaS: Decline
    note right of VPPaaS: Deletion cancelled - record unchanged
  end

else promise = false
  VPPaaS-->Camunda: Decline
  Camunda->Prosumer: Decide what to do next\n(retry or abort)
end
deactivate VPPaaS
